  "contents": [
    {
      "words": "Well, look at that, Commander. Smash and grab, just like a mercenary should. I would say it's impressive, but you still lack the elan of a Guards unit.",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Davion_Boyar_Christophoros",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "You don't need to be a Gaurd to be competent, something you might like to learn considering we carried you through this mission.",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_DariusDefault",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "You have no right to insult me like that. Continue to do so and I may need to seek satisfaction!",
      "wordsColor": {
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "a": 1
      },
      "selectedCastDefId": "castDef_Davion_Boyar_Christophoros",
      "emote": "Default",
      "audioName": "NONE",
      "cameraFocusGuid": "",
      "cameraDistance": "Far",
      "cameraHeight": "Default",
      "revealRadius": -1
    },
    {
      "words": "Then you best pipe down, Lieutentant, the Commander's not one to mess around when challenged.",
